IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CACHEBLEND-KV.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BLEND-WEIGHT-PCT    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SHARED-PREFIX-TOK   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 MEM-REDUCTION-PCT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CACHEBLEND.
    IF DIM-D == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 64 TO SHARED-PREFIX-TOK.
    MOVE 48 TO MEM-REDUCTION-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 MEM-REDUCTION-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 SHARED-PREFIX-TOK.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
